{"sections":[{"slug":"Frenkel-LP-CFT-notes","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Frenkel-LP-CFT-notes"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Frenkel - Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领与共形场论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">笔记</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Frenkel - Langlands 纲领与共形场论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"笔记"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本页梳理</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Frenkel-LP-CFT","text":"Frenkel <span lang=\"zh\">的文章</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中我感兴趣的部分</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">第一部分</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领之起源</span></h2>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">第二部分</span> <span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">纲领</span></h2>\n<h3>6.2 <span lang=\"zh\">非</span> Abel Fourier–Mukai <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们期待如下两个范畴之间由非</span> Abel Fourier–Mukai <span lang=\"zh\">变换给出的等价</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathrm{Loc}_{^L G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> $\\mathcal O$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的导出范畴</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathrm{Bun}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> D-<span lang=\"zh\">模的导出范畴</span>;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $\\mathrm{Loc}_{^L G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一点</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的摩天大楼层对应</span> $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上以</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为特征值的</span> Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">特征层</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">为此</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只需构造</span> $\\mathrm{Loc}_{^L G} \\times \\mathrm{Bun}_G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">万有</span> Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">特征层</span>” $P_G$, <span lang=\"zh\">以之为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">积分核</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的积分变换给出想要的非</span> Abel Fourier–Mukai <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span>.</p>\n<h3>6.3 <span lang=\"zh\">双参数形变</span></h3>\n<p>$\\mathrm{Loc}_{^L G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathrm{Bun}_G^\\circ$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">扭曲余切丛</span>”.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">第三部分</span> <span lang=\"zh\">共形场论</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}